{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13213170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13213170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1321317001:1":{"text":"조금 전의 그 손님들이시군요! 잘 됐네요... 제발 절 좀 도와주세요!","source_cn":"你们是刚才的客人！太好了……请一定要帮帮我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD955A508438245E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321317002:1":{"text":"침착하게 천천히 말씀해 보세요. 무슨 일이에요?","source_cn":"别着急，慢慢说，究竟发生了什么事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51186269AB247141","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321317003:1":{"text":"야생 늑대예요! 근처에 야생 늑대가 있어요!","source_cn":"是野狼！这附近有野狼出没！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x656C79537CCC1E8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321317004:1":{"text":"순록을 데리고 화이트 베어 온천 여관으로 배달을 잘 가던 중이었는데... 길가에서 갑자기 야생 늑대 몇 마리가 튀어나올 줄이야!","source_cn":"我领着驯鹿往白熊旅店运货，原本好好走在路上……可没想到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F1C2C9DAA468C3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321317005:1":{"text":"저는 순록이 깜짝 놀라 야생 늑대를 발로 몇 번 찬 덕분에 도망칠 수 있었어요. 원래는 여관으로 가서 도움을 요청하려고 했는데 다리를 다치는 바람에 뛸 수가 없게 되어서...","source_cn":"驯鹿受到惊吓，踹了那些野狼好几脚，我这才趁机逃了出来。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x702EE74D87F92BD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321317006:1":{"text":"여러분을 만나서 정말 다행이에요! 부탁이에요, 저 야생 늑대를 쫓아내고 순록을 구해주세요! 만약 순록이 다쳐서 물건을 잃어버리면... 바딤 사장님이 절 가만두지 않을 거예요!","source_cn":"——幸好遇到了你们！求求你们，帮我赶走那些野狼，救救驯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD9B3493F584C3AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321317007:1":{"text":"순록과 그 야생 늑대는 어디 있나요?","source_cn":"驯鹿和那些野狼在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB571F464FB1FBE20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321317008:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">오솔길을 따라 북쪽으로 가면</style>, 보일 거예요! 여신이시여... 순록과 물건이 무사하도록 보우하소서!","source_cn":"<style=highlight>沿着小路往北</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x677E92849A82444A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:运货员工":{"text":"운송 직원","source":"运货员工","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}